    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      164.2,
      167.37,
      345.03,
      190.71
    ],
    "text": "2 Recovery of Damages for the Death of a Person",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      177.2,
      203.82,
      301.06,
      215.16
    ],
    "text": "4. Where an applicant dies\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      188.2,
      227.82,
      387.5,
      239.16
    ],
    "text": "(a) before a claim under this Act is made; or",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      188.2,
      251.82,
      406.73,
      275.16
    ],
    "text": "(b) after a claim is made but before a judgment is delivered,",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      164.2,
      287.82,
      406.72,
      311.16
    ],
    "text": "the heirs, executors or administrators of such deceased applicant shall have no right for the damages.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      165.2,
      323.82,
      406.74,
      371.16
    ],
    "text": "5. The Court may, for the purpose of deciding any matter under this Act, call on one or more persons specially skilled in any matter relevant to the matter under consideration, for assistance.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      165.2,
      383.82,
      406.72,
      407.16
    ],
    "text": "6. Any applicant who has abandoned the deceased person shall not be entitled to claim damages under this Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      165.2,
      427.82,
      406.72,
      463.16
    ],
    "text": "7. The provisions of this Act shall be in addition to and not in derogation of any other right or remedy provided by any other written law or unwritten law.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      165.2,
      487.82,
      406.73,
      511.16
    ],
    "text": "8. In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhala and Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      411.0,
      325.11,
      455.88,
      343.79
    ],
    "text": "Assistance of an expert.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      411.0,
      204.71,
      448.55,
      223.39
    ],
    "text": "No right of succession.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      411.0,
      385.31,
      456.1,
      423.19
    ],
    "text": "Damages where abandonment has occurred.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      411.0,
      429.2,
      455.51,
      526.88
    ],
    "text": "The provisions of this Act in addition to any other remedy.Sinhala text to prevail in case of inconsistency.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
